  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Pengertian Dasar</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Sinonim (Persamaan Kata):</strong> Kata-kata yang memiliki arti sama atau sangat mirip.</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><strong>Sinonim (Persamaan Kata):</strong> Kata-kata yang memiliki arti sama atau sangat mirip.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Antonim (Lawan Kata):</strong> Kata-kata yang memiliki arti berlawanan.</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><strong>Antonim (Lawan Kata):</strong> Kata-kata yang memiliki arti berlawanan.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"notion-divider\" />\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Contoh Sinonim (Persamaan Kata)</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pintar = Pandai</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Pintar = Pandai</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Rapi = Apik</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Rapi = Apik</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pembohong = Pembual</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Pembohong = Pembual</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Alim = Saleh</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Alim = Saleh</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Nakal = Badung</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Nakal = Badung</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Cermat = Teliti</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Cermat = Teliti</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Supel = Luwes</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Supel = Luwes</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pemarah = Penggerutu</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Pemarah = Penggerutu</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Rajin = Giat</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Rajin = Giat</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Lucu = Jenaka</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Lucu = Jenaka</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Angkuh = Sombong</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Angkuh = Sombong</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Besar = Luas</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Besar = Luas</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Berani = Gagah</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Berani = Gagah</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Indah = Cantik</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Indah = Cantik</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Senang = Bahagia</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Senang = Bahagia</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Cepat = Kilat</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Cepat = Kilat</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"notion-divider\" />\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Contoh Antonim (Lawan Kata)</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Panas &gt;&lt; Dingin</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Panas &gt;&lt; Dingin</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Ringan &gt;&lt; Berat</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Ringan &gt;&lt; Berat</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Malas &gt;&lt; Rajin</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Malas &gt;&lt; Rajin</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tinggi &gt;&lt; Rendah</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tinggi &gt;&lt; Rendah</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Mahal &gt;&lt; Murah</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Mahal &gt;&lt; Murah</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Terang &gt;&lt; Gelap</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Terang &gt;&lt; Gelap</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Cepat &gt;&lt; Lambat</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Cepat &gt;&lt; Lambat</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Kaya &gt;&lt; Miskin</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Kaya &gt;&lt; Miskin</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Besar &gt;&lt; Kecil</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Besar &gt;&lt; Kecil</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Senang &gt;&lt; Sedih</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Senang &gt;&lt; Sedih</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Terbuka &gt;&lt; Tertutup</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Terbuka &gt;&lt; Tertutup</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Berani &gt;&lt; Penakut</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Berani &gt;&lt; Penakut</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pintar &gt;&lt; Bodoh</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Pintar &gt;&lt; Bodoh</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Sehat &gt;&lt; Sakit</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Sehat &gt;&lt; Sakit</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Hemat &gt;&lt; Boros</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Hemat &gt;&lt; Boros</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Masuk &gt;&lt; Keluar</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Masuk &gt;&lt; Keluar</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Asli &gt;&lt; Palsu</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\